@startuml
title State diagram for the Safehome Security Function

[*] --> InitialCheck : power-on

state "Initial Check" as InitialCheck
state "Problem During Startup" as ProblemStartup
state "Ready to Use" as ReadyToUse
state "Monitoring" as Monitoring
state "Alarm and Alert" as AlarmAlert
state "Normal Operation" as NormalOperation

InitialCheck --> ProblemStartup : problem during startup
ProblemStartup --> [*] : stop system

InitialCheck --> ReadyToUse : everything fine during startup

ReadyToUse --> Reset : reset by user
Reset --> ReadyToUse : reset complete

ReadyToUse --> Activate : activate by user
Activate --> Monitoring : start monitoring

Monitoring --> AlarmAlert : sensor triggered
AlarmAlert --> Monitoring : false alarm or time ends

Monitoring --> NormalOperation : deactivate by user

NormalOperation --> ReadyToUse : enter password

@enduml
